{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045170/extras/fadffb48b2fd43ca0983280668c9bfb6.avif?t=1764728151\" width=1265 height=409 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play a strategic and fast-paced spin on the classic game of bingo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this shady underground version of bingo, <strong>you</strong> make the calls, and <strong>you</strong> control the balls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Draw a selection of balls and place in matching spaces for bonuses or strategize your placements and craft the perfect high-scoring line with a set bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Watch out though, because if you can't reach the goal before your draws reach 0, It's all over.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's up to you to make sure that Betty's last Social Security and Disability checks won't go to waste by completing all 28 rounds in this twisted take on bingo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045170/extras/343042e5268fc148eac5391676f0f2a3.avif?t=1764728151\" width=702 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become a bingo behemoth, blasting through blackouts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Abuse powerful effects, and blast through multiple cards with every ball placement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Snowball your run and build the combo of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Break the game with extreme scores!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045170/extras/684005ae8d56cf932ee82e44ca5dc0d5.avif?t=1764728151\" width=702 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Augment your run with powerful permanent effects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i><strong>Blotters\u00a0</strong></i>in the shop on your cards to turn your luck over with various bonuses, or even to create permanent chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't like the cards you have? Buy more and jazz them up to your liking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are <u><strong>over 10</strong></u>\u00a0different blotter effects to choose from, so get creative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045170/extras/83985f64095fce834956c4a9fd2e9bd9.avif?t=1764728151\" width=702 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Track your stats, unlocks, and achievements in the collection!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock various items and even new characters as you play and uncover achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a06 Playable Senior Citizens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>200 Achievements to unlock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_parag