effects!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i><strong>Blotters\u00a0</strong></i>in the shop on your cards to turn your luck over with various bonuses, or even to create permanent chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don't like the cards you have? Buy more and jazz them up to your liking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are <u><strong>over 10</strong></u>\u00a0different blotter effects to choose from, so get creative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045170/extras/83985f64095fce834956c4a9fd2e9bd9.avif?t=1764728151\" width=702 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Track your stats, unlocks, and achievements in the collection!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock various items and even new characters as you play and uncover achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a06 Playable Senior Citizens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>200 Achievements to unlock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Over 150 Passive Items to collect!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a032 Cards to customize and blackout!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>30 Scratch Tickets to complete for various rewards!</strong> </p>","developers":["Elias Austin"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste